# Vocabulary quiz = track only

Do **not** restore click-to-reveal (`quiz-reveal-*`) or API-shell SEO pages that only load `vocabulary-quiz.js` without `VOCAB_QUIZ_TRACK_WORDS`.

## Required UX
- Typed answers with soft/similar-answer matching
- Modes: 영어 → 한글, 한글 → 영어, and 객관식 (`#m-en` / `#m-ko` / `#m-mc`) — all three required on every quiz page
- SEO pages under `vocabulary-quiz/<slug>/` must embed `VOCAB_QUIZ_TRACK_WORDS` and `vocabulary-quiz-track.js`

## Generation
- `uploadVocabularyQuiz` / `buildQuizSeoPageHtml` must always pass `pairs` or `trackWords`
- Missing track data must **throw**, never fall back to reveal/API shell HTML
- After bulk SEO changes: `cd backend && node scripts/assert-quiz-track-format.js`

## Forbidden
- Writing SEO HTML with `vocabulary-quiz.js` as the quiz renderer
- Re-adding `renderRevealSection` / `quiz-reveal-*` UI
